      "summary_zh": "迁移实验中的人工监督循环以预先写定的检查条件和 Oracle 执行结果筛选提示段与 Harness 修复，保留到后续版本；与记忆和策略 ranker 实验分开。同一语料反复参与调试且规模变化，原始工件未公开，不能当作自主改进或独立留出集验证。",
      "summary_en": "A human-supervised migration study selects prompt paragraphs and Harness fixes using prespecified checks and Oracle execution results, retaining revisions across versions; memory and strategy-ranker experiments are separate. The same corpus is repeatedly used for debugging and changes in size; raw artifacts remain internal, so this is not evidence of autonomous improvement or independent holdout validation.",
