      "summary_zh": "提出自生成提示、工具和工作流配置的持久准入理论：先冻结候选，再以新鲜审计样本和预定指标决定采纳，并约束相对参考版本的退化。证据来自合成统计实验，尚无真实 Agent 实证；保证受抽样、评估有效性与目标分布假设限制。",
      "summary_en": "Develops a theory for persistent adoption of generated prompt, tool and workflow configurations: freeze a candidate, audit it with fresh observations and prespecified metrics, and constrain degradation relative to a reference. Evidence comes from synthetic statistical experiments, not a real-agent study; guarantees depend on sampling, evaluation validity and target-distribution assumptions.",
