      "summary_zh": "用反馈优化推理、检索和工具能力的路由指令，再将保留的提示用于后续查询，比较路由质量与下游表现。部分下游数据与前序数据重叠且标签事后修正；所列节省不含路由器开销，两部分测量环境不同，不能当作端到端成本或延迟收益。",
      "summary_en": "Optimizes capability-routing instructions for reasoning, retrieval and tools from feedback, then reuses the retained prompts on later queries to study routing and downstream behavior. Some downstream data overlap earlier data and labels were revised after analysis. Reported savings omit router overhead and the measurements use different environments, so they are not end-to-end cost or latency gains.",
